---
import StarlightPage from '@astrojs/starlight/components/StarlightPage.astro'

const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '')
---

<StarlightPage
  frontmatter={{
    title: 'Page not found',
    description: 'The requested page does not exist.',
    template: 'splash',
  }}
  hasSidebar={false}
>
  <p lang="ko">이 주소에는 문서가 없습니다. 아래 목록에서 필요한 문서를 찾아 주세요.</p>
  <p>There is no page at this address. Pick a starting point below.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href={`${base}/en/getting-started`}>Getting Started</a></li>
    <li lang="ko"><a href={`${base}/ko/getting-started`}>시작하기</a></li>
  </ul>
</StarlightPage>
